            "rating": "5.0",
            "quote": "\"My feet haven't looked this healthy in years!\"",
            "details": "I'd been dealing with athlete's foot for over 3 years. Tried every cream at the pharmacy, even prescription stuff. Nothing stuck. My buddy told me about Verra Rituel and I figured why not. After the first week the cracking between my toes started closing up. By week 3 my feet looked NORMAL again. Not peeling, not red, not itchy. I actually wore sandals for the first time in forever. This soap is the real deal.",
