            "card_bg_color": ""
          }
        },
        "review_2": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "4.9",
            "quote": "\"The smell is finally gone — my wife noticed first!\"",
            "details": "I'm gonna be honest — the foot odor was BAD. I tried powders, sprays, even soaking my feet in vinegar like the internet said. Nothing worked for more than a day. Started using Verra Rituel every morning in the shower and by end of the first week my shoes didn't smell anymore. My wife actually said something. She was like 'what changed?' I just smiled. Three bars in and I'll never go back to anything else.",
            "author_name": "DAVID R.",
            "tag_1": "Odor Control",
            "tag_2": "Daily Use",
            "card_bg_color": ""
          }
        },
        "review_3": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "4.8",
            "quote": "\"I stopped hiding my feet at the gym!\"",
            "details": "As someone who works out every day, the locker room was my nightmare. I had ringworm on my foot that kept coming back no matter what I used. I felt so embarrassed I'd change in a bathroom stall. A trainer at my gym recommended Verra Rituel. Within 2 weeks the patches started shrinking. By week 4 they were gone. Completely. I'm back to showering at the gym with zero stress. Genuinely life-changing for me.",
            "author_name": "JAMES K.",
            "tag_1": "Ringworm",
            "tag_2": "Active Lifestyle",
            "card_bg_color": ""
          }
        },
        "review_4": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5.0",
            "quote": "\"My dermatologist was impressed with the results!\"",
            "details": "I went to the derm for a persistent fungal issue on my hands and feet. They gave me a prescription cream that kind of helped but it kept coming back. I added Verra Rituel to my daily shower routine and at my follow-up visit even my doctor noticed the improvement. She asked what I changed. The combination of natural ingredients in this bar just works differently. My skin is clear and the fungus hasn't returned in 3 months.",
            "author_name": "SARAH L.",
            "tag_1": "Dermatologist Approved",
            "tag_2": "Long-Term Relief",
            "card_bg_color": ""
          }
        },
        "review_5": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "4.9",
            "quote": "\"Finally, something that actually keeps fungus away.\"",
            "details": "I've dealt with jock itch on and off for years. Every summer it came back worse. Creams would clear it temporarily but it always returned. Verra Rituel is the first thing that's kept it from coming back. I use it every day and haven't had a flare-up in over 4 months. The tea tree scent is clean and not overpowering. Best purchase I've made for my skin.",
