            "heading": "Fights Fungus AND Odor Together",
            "details": "<p>Why use two products when one does both? Verra Rituel kills the fungus causing the smell while activated charcoal neutralizes odor. Clean skin and fresh scent in a single bar.</p>"
          }
        },
        "reason_3": {
          "type": "reason_card",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Reason 3",
            "heading": "Easiest Routine You'll Ever Have",
            "details": "<p>No creams to rub in. No sprays to time. No pills to remember. Just lather during your normal shower and rinse. It fits into the routine you already have — zero extra effort.</p>"
          }
        },
        "reason_4": {
          "type": "reason_card",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Reason 4",
            "heading": "100% Natural & Gentle on Skin",
            "details": "<p>No parabens, no sulfates, no harsh chemicals. Just Tea Tree, Eucalyptus, and Activated Charcoal — dermatologist-recommended ingredients that are tough on fungus but gentle on your skin.</p>"
          }
        },
        "reason_5": {
