    "collapsible_content_vr": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does the Verra Rituel™ Antifungal Soap work?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Verra Rituel combines three clinically studied natural ingredients. <strong>Tea Tree Oil</strong> kills fungus by disrupting fungal cell membranes. <strong>Eucalyptus Oil</strong> provides deep antiseptic cleansing. <strong>Activated Charcoal</strong> draws out toxins and neutralizes odor. Just lather, let it sit for 60 seconds, and rinse — your skin does the rest.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long will it take to see results?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Most people notice visible improvement <strong>within the first 1–2 weeks</strong>. Itching and odor typically reduce within days. Full clearance builds over <strong>30 days</strong> of daily use. Every case is different — mild infections clear faster, stubborn ones may take the full month. Consistency is key.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What types of fungal infections does it treat?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Verra Rituel is effective against <strong>athlete's foot, jock itch, ringworm, toenail fungus symptoms, and general body fungus</strong>. The tea tree oil formula works on multiple fungal strains. For severe or persistent infections, we recommend pairing with advice from your healthcare provider.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it safe for sensitive skin?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Verra Rituel is <strong>hypoallergenic, paraben-free, and sulfate-free</strong>. It's made with natural ingredients and is gentle enough for daily use on all skin types, including sensitive skin. If you have a known allergy to tea tree oil, consult your doctor first.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I use it on my whole body?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Absolutely. While it's especially effective on <strong>feet, groin, and body areas prone to fungal growth</strong>, Verra Rituel is safe to use as a full-body soap. Many customers use it as their daily shower bar for overall skin health and odor prevention.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does one bar last?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>One bar typically lasts <strong>4–6 weeks</strong> with daily use on targeted areas. If used as a full-body wash, it may last 3–4 weeks. We recommend the 2-pack or 3-pack for uninterrupted treatment and the best value.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_7": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will the fungus come back after I stop using it?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Unlike creams that only address symptoms, Verra Rituel <strong>helps rebuild your skin's natural protective barrier</strong>. Many customers report that fungus stays gone after completing a 30-day routine. For prevention, we recommend continuing to use the bar 2–3 times per week even after your skin clears.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_8": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you offer a guarantee?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! Every order is backed by our <strong>30-day money-back guarantee</strong>. If you don't see visible improvement — less fungus, less odor, healthier skin — just reach out and we'll refund you in full. No hassle, no questions. We believe in this product that much.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
